### ✅ 步骤 3：修改类 SeamLogInjectionRule 示例

#### 修改前：

```java
public class SeamLogInjectionRule extends AbstractJavaRule {

    public SeamLogInjectionRule() {
        super.addRuleChainVisit(ASTMethodCall.class);
    }

    @Override
    public Object visit(ASTMethodCall node, Object data) {
        if (isLogMethod(node) && isConcatenationInLog(node)) {
            addViolation(data, node);
        }
        return super.visit(node, data);
    }
}
```

#### 修改后（PMD 7 适配）：

```java
import net.sourceforge.pmd.lang.java.ast.ASTMethodCall;
import net.sourceforge.pmd.lang.java.ast.JavaNode;
import net.sourceforge.pmd.lang.java.rule.AbstractJavaRule;
import net.sourceforge.pmd.lang.ast.RuleContext;

public class SeamLogInjectionRule extends AbstractJavaRule {

    @Override
    public JavaNodeVisitor getVisitor() {
        return new JavaVisitor() {
            @Override
            public Visitable visit(ASTMethodCall node, RuleContext ctx) {
                if (isLogMethod(node) && isConcatenationInLog(node)) {
                    ctx.addViolation(node, "Avoid string concatenation in log statements.");
                }
                return super.visit(node, ctx);
            }
        };
    }

    private boolean isLogMethod(ASTMethodCall node) {
        return "info".equals(node.getMethodName()) && node.getArgumentCount() == 1;
    }

    private boolean isConcatenationInLog(ASTMethodCall node) {
        return node.ancestors().ofType(ASTMethodCall.class).nonEmpty()
               && node.toString().contains("+");
    }
}
```

